--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bec64d7ff936d5c4e96a68baae041392, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1510658060288
    m_Localized: Wait... But this is just a bun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1758939885568
    m_Localized: Thank you very much, grandson!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 342973342330880
    m_Localized: Of course, right away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343296698003456
    m_Localized: Come on, don't take too long!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 784586262753280
    m_Localized: Actually, I haven't opened yet, but I'm not going to refuse grandfather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 786990186147840
    m_Localized: First, you need to roll it out...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 788562282590208
    m_Localized: What comes next..? I need to check.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49924583424
    m_Localized: Hello, grandson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 133852606464
    m_Localized: Can you wrap a pie for me, please?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781362250559488
    m_Localized: It all starts with rolling out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781418970132480
    m_Localized: Here you need to fold it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781500616454144
    m_Localized: Here we'll hold it down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781529372602368
    m_Localized: Damn! I forgot to add the filling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781784918962176
    m_Localized: We'll fix it quickly now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781864115810304
    m_Localized: This time I won't forget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4781916146151424
    m_Localized: Well, it seems ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4794554578153472
    m_Localized: Just open your diner already!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410195581976576
    m_Localized: Press B to open the recipe book and select the regular pie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410281082863616
    m_Localized: 'Hold down the left mouse button to take the rolling pin.

      Hold
      down the right mouse button to roll it out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410397290250240
    m_Localized: Hold down and drag the left mouse button to fold the dough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410465800011776
    m_Localized: Press the right mouse button to knead the dough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410562151563264
    m_Localized: 'The dough can be dragged by holding down both mouse buttons.

      Move
      the item to the dough bowl to get rid of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410641658789888
    m_Localized: Take a new piece of dough from the bowl by pressing LMB.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410779764637696
    m_Localized: Add any of the fillings to the dough by holding down LMB.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5410856822390784
    m_Localized: Move the finished product to the oven by releasing it over the fire
      area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5426067935608832
    m_Localized: After adding the wood, it needs to catch fire first. Once it burns
      down, its heat will gradually decrease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5426142120263680
    m_Localized: You need to keep an eye on the pastry and take them out of the hot
      oven in time. The degree of doneness can be determined by their appearance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5796121808777216
    m_Localized: Looks like it's time for the cafe to open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5829916545036288
    m_Localized: I'll throw a log, it should be enough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5866986432933888
    m_Localized: Okay, quickly, before the log burns through completely
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5867008893431808
    m_Localized: Need to close the hatch so the heat doesn't escape
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
